---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AsciiLab from '../components/AsciiLab.astro';
import {profile,projects,skills} from '../data/profile.mjs';
import {themes} from '../data/themes.mjs';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout>
<header class="site-header"><nav class="container nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="Vishal KVS home">vishal<span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="brand-tag">/ a work in progress</span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#contact">Say hello ↗</a></div><div class="nav-tools"><button class="command-trigger" data-command-open aria-label="Open command palette">⌘ <kbd>K</kbd></button><button class="theme-trigger" data-theme-open aria-haspopup="dialog"><span class="theme-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-theme-name>Solarized Light</span><span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button></div></nav></header>
<main id="main"><section class="container hero" id="home" aria-labelledby="hero-heading"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow hero-enter"><span class="live-dot"></span> Hi, I’m Vishal KVS. Make yourself at home.</div><h1 id="hero-heading"><span class="hero-line">A curious mind.</span><span class="hero-line">An open tab.</span><span class="hero-line"><em>Endless possibility.</em></span></h1><p class="hero-intro hero-enter">Computer Science student building toward AI/ML engineering. Turning questions into experiments, and experiments into things you can explore.</p><div class="role-line hero-enter"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span> currently exploring <span id="rotating-role">machine learning</span><span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true">_</span></div><div class="hero-actions hero-enter"><a class="button primary magnetic" href="#work">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a class="underlink" href="#contact">Let’s connect <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-footnote hero-enter"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> Built with curiosity. Best explored with yours.</div></div><div class="hero-visual hero-enter"><div class="handnote">a little playground for your curiosity <span aria-hidden="true">↴</span></div><AsciiLab/><figure class="photo-card"><img src={`${base}images/vishal.jpeg`} alt="Vishal smiling while holding a white dog" width="1280" height="960" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>me, off the keyboard <span aria-hidden="true">☺</span></figcaption></figure><span class="visual-coordinate" aria-hidden="true">[ ideas, in motion ]</span></div></section>
<div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ticker-track">{[0,1,2,3].map(()=> <span>ROOTED IN CURIOSITY <b>✳</b> GROWING THROUGH CODE <b>✳</b> ALWAYS A WORK IN PROGRESS <b>✳</b> EXPLORING AI & ML <b>✳</b></span>)}</div></div>
<section class="container section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading"><div class="section-heading reveal"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / Selected explorations</div><h2 id="work-heading">Ideas with <em>their sleeves rolled up.</em></h2></div><p>Some finished. Some unfolding.<br>All part of figuring things out.</p></div><div class="work-toolbar reveal"><div class="filter-group" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects"><button data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All work <span>02</span></button><button data-filter="ml" aria-pressed="false">AI & ML</button><button data-filter="web" aria-pressed="false">Web</button></div><span class="mono small" id="project-count" aria-live="polite">2 explorations</span></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.map(p=><article class="project-card reveal" data-category={p.category}><a class="project-image" href={p.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`Explore ${p.title} on GitHub`}><div class="art-top"><span>{p.label}</span><span>/{p.number}</span></div>{p.ascii==='scatter'?<div class="scatter-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="scatter-grid"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 400 170" fill="none"><path d="M30 140C85 145 88 76 145 94S222 20 282 44 330 20 370 26" class="plot-line"/><g class="plot-dots">{[[52,132],[89,99],[126,103],[166,79],[195,65],[237,39],[278,55],[320,24],[352,42]].map(([cx,cy])=><circle cx={cx} cy={cy} r="4"/>)}</g></svg><pre class="plot-ascii">{'[ data → patterns → possibility ]'}</pre></div>:<div class="browser-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mini-browser"><div class="mini-bar">○ ○ ○ <span>localhost:curiosity</span></div><div class="mini-body"><span>&lt;hello world /&gt;</span><pre>{'     .  *  .\n   . : + : .\n  * : @@@ : *\n   . : + : .\n     .  *  .'}</pre></div><span class="mini-cursor">↖</span></div></div>}<div class="art-bottom"><span>View source on GitHub</span><span class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div></a><div class="project-content"><h3>{p.title}</h3><p>{p.description}</p><ul class="tags">{p.tags.map(tag=><li>{tag}</li>)}</ul><details><summary>A closer look <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{p.detail}</p></details></div></article>)}</div><div class="workbench reveal"><div class="workbench-ascii" aria-hidden="true"><pre>{' o───o───o\n │ ╲ │ ╱ │\n o───@───o\n │ ╱ │ ╲ │\n o───o───o'}</pre></div><div><div class="eyebrow">Currently on the workbench</div><h3>What if networks could adapt?</h3><p>Exploring AI-driven adaptive network traffic management with software-defined networking and machine learning.</p></div><span class="status-pill"><span class="live-dot"></span> Course project · In progress</span></div></section>
<section class="container section about-section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading"><div class="about-copy reveal"><div class="eyebrow">02 / Behind the open tabs</div><h2 id="about-heading">Still learning.<br><em>Always making.</em></h2><p class="lead">I’m Vishal, a Computer Science undergraduate drawn to the place where solid foundations meet interesting possibilities.</p><p>My interests connect algorithms and probability with applied machine learning. I’m learning through coursework, hands-on experiments, and open-source projects.</p><p>I like making things I can take apart, understand, and make a little better. This website is one of them.</p><a class="underlink" href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">More about me on LinkedIn ↗</a><div class="course-note"><span aria-hidden="true">↳</span><p>In my notebooks lately: Algorithms, Probability & Random Processes, Machine Learning, Neural Networks & Deep Learning.</p></div></div><div class="toolbox reveal"><div class="toolbox-header"><span class="mono small">toolkit.config</span><span class="small muted">Always evolving</span></div><div class="skill-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore my toolkit">{skills.map((s,i)=><button role="tab" id={`tab-${s.id}`} data-skill={s.id} aria-controls={`panel-${s.id}`} aria-selected={i===0?'true':'false'} tabindex={i===0?0:-1}>{s.label}</button>)}</div>{skills.map((s,i)=><div class="skill-panel" id={`panel-${s.id}`} role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`tab-${s.id}`} tabindex="0" hidden={i!==0}><ul class="skill-list">{s.items.map((item,j)=><li><span class="mono muted">0{j+1}</span><span>{item}</span><span class="skill-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></li>)}</ul><p>{s.note}</p><pre class="code-note">{s.code}</pre></div>)}<div class="toolbox-footer"><span class="live-dot"></span> Learning by building. Building by learning.</div></div></section>
<section class="contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><div class="container contact-inner"><div class="contact-ascii reveal" aria-hidden="true"><pre id="contact-ascii">{'       .     +     .\n    .     . : .     .\n  +    . :  ✳  : .    +\n    .     . : .     .\n       .     +     .'}</pre></div><div class="eyebrow reveal">03 / A conversation is a good place to start</div><h2 class="reveal" id="contact-heading">Interesting things happen<br>after <em>“hello.”</em></h2><p class="reveal">Building something? Learning something? Just curious?<br>I’d love to hear what you’re thinking about.</p><a class="button primary magnetic reveal" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Let’s start a conversation ↗</a><div class="contact-links reveal"><a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><button id="copy-email">Copy email <span aria-hidden="true">⧉</span></button></div><p class="copy-status" id="copy-status" role="status"></p></div></section></main>
<footer class="container footer"><a class="brand" href="#home">vishal<span aria-hidden="true">✳</span></a><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Vishal KVS · Made with care & curiosity.</span><a class="mono small" href="#home">Back to top ↑</a></footer><div class="status-bar"><div><span class="live-dot"></span><span id="section-status">~/home</span></div><button id="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Motion: on</button><button data-theme-open class="status-theme">◐ <span data-theme-name>Solarized Light</span></button><span class="status-stack">Astro + GSAP</span><span id="scroll-percent">0%</span></div>
<dialog id="theme-dialog" class="palette-dialog" aria-labelledby="theme-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="theme-title">A change of atmosphere.</h2><button class="close-dialog" data-close="theme-dialog" aria-label="Close theme picker">×</button></div><p class="dialog-intro">Familiar palettes from VS Code. Pick your happy place.</p><div class="theme-grid">{themes.map(t=><button class="theme-option" data-theme-choice={t.id} aria-pressed={t.id==='solarized-light'}><span class="theme-preview" style={`--swatch-bg:${t.bg};--swatch-panel:${t.panel};--swatch-ink:${t.ink};--swatch-accent:${t.accent};--swatch-secondary:${t.secondary}`} aria-hidden="true"><i></i><span><b></b><b></b><b></b></span><em>Aa</em></span><span class="theme-option-label">{t.name}<span class="theme-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span></span></button>)}</div><div class="dialog-footer">Your choice stays with you. <kbd>Esc</kbd> to close</div></dialog>
<dialog id="command-dialog" class="palette-dialog command-dialog" aria-labelledby="command-title"><div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="command-title">Where shall we go?</h2><button class="close-dialog" data-close="command-dialog" aria-label="Close command palette">×</button></div><label class="sr-only" for="command-search">Search pages and themes</label><input id="command-search" placeholder="Search pages, actions, themes…" autocomplete="off"/><div id="command-results"><a class="command-item" href="#home" data-command="home introduction">↖ <span>Back to the beginning</span><small>Home</small></a><a class="command-item" href="#work" data-command="work projects code">↘ <span>Explore my work</span><small>Work</small></a><a class="command-item" href="#about" data-command="about skills toolkit">⌘ <span>Meet the person behind the code</span><small>About</small></a><a class="command-item" href="#contact" data-command="contact email hello">↗ <span>Start a conversation</span><small>Contact</small></a><button class="command-item" data-theme-open data-command="theme appearance color settings">◐ <span>Change the atmosphere</span><small>Themes</small></button>{themes.map(t=><button class="command-item" data-theme-choice={t.id} data-command={`theme ${t.name.toLowerCase()}`}><span class="command-swatch" style={`background:${t.accent}`}></span><span>{t.name}</span><small>Theme</small></button>)}</div><p id="command-empty" hidden>No matches. Try “work”, “email”, or a theme name.</p><div class="dialog-footer"><span><kbd>↑</kbd> <kbd>↓</kbd> to explore · <kbd>Enter</kbd> to select</span><span><kbd>Esc</kbd> to close</span></div></dialog>
<noscript><div class="no-script">You can explore all projects and contact links without JavaScript. Interactive art and theme switching need JavaScript.</div></noscript>
</Layout>
